Package: zcode
Version: 0.1
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Uchida <uchida@local>
Depends: libc6
Recommends: skkdic, python3
Description: VS Code-like code editor for CardputerZero APPLaunch
 Draws directly on the built-in LCD (fb0) and reads the keyboard (evdev).
 Syntax highlighting, file tree, built-in SKK Japanese input (shares
 ~/.skk-uim-jisyo with uim-skk), Markdown live preview, integrated
 terminal with F5 run, word completion, save-time checks, outline,
 shortcut list (F1) and crash/power-loss backups of unsaved edits.
